                                    <button id="component-popup-grid-open-hidden" class="btn btn-outline-secondary" type="button">@LocalText("Má»Ÿ tab Grid & Data List", "Open Grid & Data List tab")</button>
                                </div>
                                <ol class="component-popup-demo-points">
                                    <li>
                                        <strong>@LocalText("1. Má»Ÿ popup", "1. Open popup")</strong>
                                        <span>@LocalText("Báº¥m nÃºt thÃªm Ä‘á»ƒ má»Ÿ form popup bootstrap.", "Click the add button to open the Bootstrap popup form.")</span>
                                    </li>
                                    <li>
                                        <strong>@LocalText("2. LÆ°u thÃ´ng tin", "2. Save details")</strong>
                                        <span>@LocalText("Nháº­p thÃ´ng tin cÃ´ng viá»‡c, báº¥m lÆ°u vÃ  nháº­n thÃ´ng bÃ¡o thÃ nh cÃ´ng/tháº¥t báº¡i.", "Enter task details, save, and receive success or failure feedback.")</span>
                                    </li>
                                    <li>
                                        <strong>@LocalText("3. Xem trÃªn grid", "3. Show on grid")</strong>
                                        <span>@LocalText("Sau khi lÆ°u, hÃª̣ thá»‘ng sáº½ chuyá»ƒn qua tab grid vÃ  hiá»ƒn thá»‹ dÃ²ng má»›i ngay.", "After saving, the page switches to the grid tab and shows the new row immediately.")</span>
                                    </li>
                                </ol>
                                <div class="helper">@LocalText("Popup cÃ³ nÃºt ÄÃ³ng Ä‘á»ƒ thoÃ¡t mÃ  khÃ´ng thay Ä‘á»•i dá»¯ liá»‡u, cÃ²n nÃºt LÆ°u sáº½ thÃªm dÃ²ng á»Ÿ tráº¡ng thÃ¡i chÆ°a commit server cho Ä‘áº¿n khi báº¡n báº¥m LÆ°u thay Ä‘á»•i trong grid.", "The popup includes a Close button to exit without changes, while Save adds a client-side row that stays pending until you click Save changes in the grid.")</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </article>

                    <article class="component-card">
                        <div class="component-card-head">
                            <div>
                                <h4>@LocalText("Common Image Attachment Control", "Common Image Attachment Control")</h4>
                                <div class="component-meta-line">@T["Components.LibraryLabel"]: Bootstrap + HTML + shared JS</div>
                            </div>
                            <span class="component-status-badge status-usable">@T["Components.StatusUsableNow"]</span>
                        </div>
                        <p class="component-note">@LocalText("Control chung để chọn, cập nhật, kéo thả, hiển thị và xóa một hình ảnh với khung preview cố định.", "A shared control for choosing, updating, drag-dropping, previewing, and removing a single image inside a fixed preview frame.")</p>
                        <div class="component-sample">
                            <partial name="/Views/Shared/Controls/_ImageUploadControl.cshtml" model="demoImageUploadControl" />
                        </div>
                    </article>

                    <article class="component-card component-card-wide">
                        <div class="component-card-head">
                            <div>
                                <h4>@LocalText("Common Attachment File Control", "Common Attachment File Control")</h4>
                                <div class="component-meta-line">@T["Components.LibraryLabel"]: Bootstrap + HTML + shared JS</div>
                            </div>
                            <span class="component-status-badge status-usable">@T["Components.StatusUsableNow"]</span>
                        </div>
                        <p class="component-note">@LocalText("Control chung để đính kèm, hiển thị, thêm file mới, kéo thả nhiều file và xóa từng dòng file với chiều cao gọn hơn.", "A shared control for attaching, listing, adding, drag-dropping multiple files, and removing each file row with a more compact height.")</p>
                        <div class="component-sample">
                            <partial name="/Views/Shared/Controls/_FileAttachmentControl.cshtml" model="demoFileAttachmentControl" />
                        </div>
                    </article>

                    <article class="component-card">
